  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Rural Belize (Be-Resilient)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is being co-financed with the International Fund for Agricultural Development (IFAD), the Green Climate Fund (GCF) and Government of Belize (GOBZ). It aims to minimize the impacts of climatic and economic events on smallholder farmers while supporting sustainable market access for their produce. It support commercially oriented small-farmers employ climate resilient agricultural practices and technologies - through investments in public and private climate resilient infrastructure, strengthening smallholder famer organisations and related/ relevant GOB capacity development.</narrative>
  </description>
